      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْنُوكٌ</span></b>  A child <i>whose</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنَك</span> [i. e. <i>palate,</i> or <i>soft
palate,</i>] <i>has been rubbed with some chewed dates,</i>
or <i>some other thing</i> (S, Msb, K) <i>of a similar
kind;</i> (Msb;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَنَّكٌ</span></b> . (S, Msb, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُنُكٌ</span>.

